    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc38 Jump, Climb, Reach the Top! \ud83c\udff0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a frog, your destiny is calling you,\u00a0<strong>upwards</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frog Jump</strong> is a challenging yet fun platforming adventure that puts your skills to the test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8b <strong>Don't make the princess wait so long!</strong> \ud83d\udc51\ud83d\udc78</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/23357b70d7dfe60b5ea89640aa702063.avif?t=1750960168\" width=616 height=180 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf55 Play Solo or with up to 8 Friends! \ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udc38</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will be the first to claim the <strong>royal kiss</strong>?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/46638844b5e8698da7fc95c69f67171c.poster.avif?t=1750960168\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/46638844b5e8698da7fc95c69f67171c.webm?t=1750960168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/46638844b5e8698da7fc95c69f67171c.mp4?t=1750960168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udca5 Sabotage Your Friend's Way to the Top!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your frog abilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Stick out your tongue to mess with enemies\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Mid-air kick to send others flying!\u00a0</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/9aec2d8db864ecb48ccff752001f8351.poster.avif?t=1750960168\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/9aec2d8db864ecb48ccff752001f8351.webm?t=1750960168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/9aec2d8db864ecb48ccff752001f8351.mp4?t=1750960168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaeEasy Controls!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just jump, it's in your nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/73b24a44583f7ff69a25100f0fd06feb.poster.avif?t=1750960168\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/73b24a44583f7ff69a25100f0fd06feb.webm?t=1750960168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/73b24a44583f7ff69a25100f0fd06feb.mp4?t=1750960168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to frog your way up there? \ud83c\udfc6\ud83d\udc38</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc38 Jump, Climb, Reach the Top! \ud83c\udff0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a frog, your destiny is calling you,\u00a0<strong>upwards</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frog Jump</strong> is a challenging yet fun platforming adventure that puts your skills to the test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8b <strong>Don't make the princess wait so long!</strong> \ud83d\udc51\ud83d\udc78</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/23357b70d7dfe60b5ea89640aa702063.avif?t=1750960168\" width=616 height=180 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf55 Play Solo or with up to 8 Friends! \ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udc38</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will be the first to claim the <strong>royal kiss</strong>?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/46638844b5e8698da7fc95c69f67171c.poster.avif?t=1750960168\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/46638844b5e8698da7fc95c69f67171c.webm?t=1750960168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/46638844b5e8698da7fc95c69f67171c.mp4?t=1750960168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udca5 Sabotage Your Friend's Way to the Top!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your frog abilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Stick out your tongue to mess with enemies\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Mid-air kick to send others flying!\u00a0</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/9aec2d8db864ecb48ccff752001f8351.poster.avif?t=1750960168\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/9aec2d8db864ecb48ccff752001f8351.webm?t=1750960168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/9aec2d8db864ecb48ccff752001f8351.mp4?t=1750960168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaeEasy Controls!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just jump, it's in your nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/73b24a44583f7ff69a25100f0fd06feb.poster.avif?t=1750960168\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/73b24a44583f7ff69a25100f0fd06feb.webm?t=1750960168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448750/extras/73b24a44583f7ff69a25100f0fd06feb.mp4?t=1750960168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to frog your way up there? \ud83c\udfc6\ud83d\udc38</strong></p>",
